=\"CENTER\">Accountant</p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">Dated_____19   .\tTreasury/Officer.</p>\n</font><font color=\"#008080\" size=\"5\"><p align=\"CENTER\">(B) IN CASE OF PAYMENT AT THE BANK</p>\n</font><font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">To</p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">\tTHE AGENT, STATE BANK OF INDIA_____</p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">Please pay *Rs. (\t\t)_____</p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">_____Treasury.</p></font>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"641\">\n<tr><td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"50%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">Dated_____19   .</p></font></td>\n<td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"50%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">Treasury Officer.</p></font></td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<font color=\"#008080\" size=\"5\"><p align=\"CENTER\">PAYEES’ DISCHARGE TO THE BANK</p>\n</font><font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">Received payment</p>\n<p align=\"RIGHT\">Name_____</p>\n<p align=\"RIGHT\">Office_____</p>\n</font><font color=\"#008080\" size=\"5\"><p align=\"CENTER\">FOR USE IN ACCOUNTANT GENERAL’S OFFICE</p>\n</font><font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">Admitted for Rs.</p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">Objected to Rs.</p></font>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"641\">\n<tr><td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"33%\"> </td>\n<td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"33%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">Auditor</p></font></td>\n<td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"33%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">Superintendent</p></font></td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">*To be stated in words and figures.</p></font>"}